We check the hotkey's CLA status against currently effective CLA version:
Check gate mode:
- If mode == `"off"`:
  Allow upload, do nothing.
- If mode == `"shadow"`:
  Check if hotkey has signed the currently effective CLA version.
  If not signed:
  Log a warning (e.g., `logger.warning(f"Shadow CLA check: unsigned hotkey {hotkey}")`) and increment a counter / record shadow metric.
