- If mode == `"enforce"`:
  Check if hotkey has signed the currently effective CLA version.
  If not signed:
  Refuse! Raise `HTTPException(status_code=403, detail="Contributor License Agreement (CLA) signature required. Please run 'ditto cla sign' before submitting.")`

