It calls the platform (e.g., `GET /api/v1/cla/status/{hotkey}` or `POST /api/v1/upload/check`) or checks if CLA is required.
If status says not signed and gate mode is enforce (or status endpoint returns signed=False and effective CLA is required):
CLI informs miner to run `ditto cla sign` and exits before packaging or payment!

