- Test ORM delete: `session.delete(sig)` -> raises error.
- Test raw SQL update: `session.execute(text("UPDATE cla_signatures SET coldkey = 'hack' WHERE id = :id", {"id": sig.id}))` -> raises DB error.
- Test raw SQL delete: `session.execute(text("DELETE FROM cla_signatures WHERE id = :id", {"id": sig.id}))` -> raises DB error.
This proves beyond doubt that there is no update or delete path!

